<title>UK: Atlantic Tel to launch Glasgow system Oct 30.</title>
<headline>Atlantic Tel to launch Glasgow system Oct 30.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Atlantic Telecom Group said on Friday it is to launch its fixed link radio access telephone system in the Scottish city of Glasgow on October 30.</p>
</text>
